%I A401775 #9 Nov 05 2026 23:07:13
%S A401775 1,2,9,21,100,284,953,2774,8749,25641,77779,230419,691322
%N A401775 Number of free polyiamonds with 2n cells that can be dissected into two congruent polyiamonds.
%C A401775 Here congruent means equal up to rotation, reflection and translation, so the two halves may be mirror images of each other. We call such a polyiamond "halvable".
%C A401775 This group of sequences is inspired by Dmitry Kamenetsky's A399996, described as "The best polyomino sequence of the year".
%H A401775 John Mason, <a href="/A401775/a401775.png">Illustration of a(3)=9.</a>
%Y A401775 Cf. A000577, A399996, A401776, A401777.
%K A401775 nonn,more,new
%O A401775 1,2
%A A401775 _John Mason_, Nov 05 2026
